WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.730
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.200
One thing's for sure--

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.690
it's very easy to lead when
things are going great,

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.231
and you've got the
wind at your back.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:17.350
It gets really hard when you've
got headwinds, disappointments,

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.260
and people are telling you
you're going the wrong way.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:24.420
Ask yourself, do I have what
it takes to lead the company,

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.880
to lead these people?

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.230
And my answer to
you is, yes, you do.

